{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756730/extras/Header_Images1.png?t=1749777691\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756730/extras/specialty.gif?t=1749777691\" /><br>Draft your forces among a wide variety of unique units, who each have a unique set of skills to exercise on the battlefield. Bully enemies by pushing and pulling them with the hearty Champion, strike and fade with the swift Cavalier, lay devastating traps with the talented Mage, and steal your opponent\u2019s life essence and donate it to your companions as a Vampire healer. <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756730/extras/Header_Images2.png?t=1749777691\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756730/extras/work-together.gif?t=1749777691\" /><br>Units have complementary skill-sets that enable a pair to accomplish more together than they would alone. Well-coordinated skills can be greater than the sum of their parts!<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756730/extras/Header_Images3.png?t=1749777691\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756730/extras/take-the-high-ground.gif?t=1749777691\" /><br>Exploit the terrain on the battlefield to gain the upper hand. Hold defensive positions, close drawbridges on unsuspecting enemies, or launch over walls to outflank your foes.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756730/extras/Header_Images6.png?t=1749777691\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756730/extras/mark-the-dawn-of-a-new-era.gif?t=1749777691\" /><br>Experience a fully-featured Campaign story that spans the continent, gathering companions to your Mercenary company, and take on challenges that grow ever greater. Fate has great (and terrible) things in store for you and your companions.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756730/extras/Header_Images5.png?t=1749777691\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756730/extras/seize-fate-and-the-castle.gif?t=1749777691\" /><br>Missions can have multiple victory conditions, and you only need to meet one to win! When you\u2019re on the back-foot, look for an opportunity to snatch victory from the jaws of defeat.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756730/extras/Header_Images4.png?t=1749777691\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756730/extras/time-your-attacks-wisely.gif?t=1749777691\" /><br>Each faction moves one unit at a time. You\u2019ll have to react to the evolving state of the battlefield as you adapt to the changing situations.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1756730?t=1749777691","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1756730?t=1749777691","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756730/d03c7a4998a93bbdf299491a4f1d12249402e0e3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749777691","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756730/d03c7a4998a93bbdf299491a4f1d12249402e0e3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749777691","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split S