lank your foes.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756730/extras/Header_Images6.png?t=1749777691\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756730/extras/mark-the-dawn-of-a-new-era.gif?t=1749777691\" /><br>Experience a fully-featured Campaign story that spans the continent, gathering companions to your Mercenary company, and take on challenges that grow ever greater. Fate has great (and terrible) things in store for you and your companions.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756730/extras/Header_Images5.png?t=1749777691\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756730/extras/seize-fate-and-the-castle.gif?t=1749777691\" /><br>Missions can have multiple victory conditions, and you only need to meet one to win! When you\u2019re on the back-foot, look for an opportunity to snatch victory from the jaws of defeat.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756730/extras/Header_Images4.png?t=1749777691\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756730/extras/time-your-attacks-wisely.gif?t=1749777691\" /><br>Each faction moves one unit at a time. You\u2019ll have to react to the evolving state of the battlefield as you adapt to the changing situations.","developers":["Talberon Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756730/7e7dc06eaf1704eeba14731062b5c7b1dae6cfd2/header.jpg?t=1749777691","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright Talberon 2021-2025. All Rights Reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><